    "description": "DocChat RAG API. All business routes live under /v1 and need `Authorization: Bearer <token>`. Errors are `{detail, code}`. `POST /v1/query` with `stream=true` replies as Server-Sent Events (`text/event-stream`, `Cache-Control: no-cache`, `X-Accel-Buffering: no`).",
